WEBVTT

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:05.270
Hooray!

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.910
We're all together!

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.480
Finally, we've found all the Precure-kuru! I'm so happy-kuru!

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.460
Well then, I would like to ask a question, if I may.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.120
Kuru?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.380
What exactly are Precure, anyway?

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.590
They're legendary warriors-kuru!

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.260
Why does being one give us such incredible powers?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.860
Because you're legendary warriors-kuru!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.400
That don't explain anythin'!{TLC: I'll leave it to you, Magenta, but Osaka-ben really, really doesn't sound like this >_<}{Which is why I'm making it normal english like we have been doing, be lucky I'm keeping the ' instead of the g :P}

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.380
Kuru?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.330
Who are those scary monsters, anyway?

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:39.630
Kuru?

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.970
What are they after?

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.270
Kuru...?

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.710
What're we supposed to do about them?

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.410
Be... legendary warriors-kuru...

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.660
I don't really know-kuru!

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.060
What...?

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:06.490
What's that?

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:08.960
A book?

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.670
Miyuki-chan?!

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.770
My apologies, fair maiden-de gozaru.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.510
Something popped out the book!

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.030
Who're you?

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.010
Allow me to introduce myself-de gozaru, I am...{TLC: long. Remove first sentence? Editing: comma splice}

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.450
I missed you, big bro!

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:31.020
What...?

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.750
He's Candy's...

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.780
...<i>brother</i>?!{TLC: sug. italics} {Editor: Uhhhm, is that what you wanted me to do? I have no clue what the sug was supposed to be short for here XD}

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.380
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.210
Smile Precure!

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:43.110
Let's go!

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.650
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.780
All together!

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.390
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.590
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.260
Smile Precure!

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.090
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.530
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:07.740
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:13.680
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:18.620
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:18.580
So bright!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:23.790
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:30.230
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:30.730
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:31.900
Let's go!

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:34.600
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.540
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:42.340
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.910
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.580
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:45.710
Everybody!

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.380
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.910
Fly to the future!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.420
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.590
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.890
Smile Precure!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.750
I missed you so much-kuru!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.780
You're still a real crybaby, aren't you, Candy{de-gozaru}?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.980
Ummm...

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.550
Oh! My most sincere apologies! My name is Pop.{Timer, this and the following were one line, I split it to two for scene convenience and cause long line is long, Editor/TLC change back at your preference.}{TLC: makes sense to me}{Editor: Wow you guys scared me when I saw the notes were bigger than the line itself... why would we make these hidden notes so big... you guys are just being ridiculous... they shouldn't be this long ( ﾟ∀ﾟ)ｱﾊﾊ八八ﾉヽﾉヽﾉヽﾉ ＼ / ＼/ ＼}

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.420
I'm most grateful for you looking after my little sister-de gozaru.{Timer, this and the following were one line, I split it to two for scene convenience and cause long line is long, Editor/TLC change back at your preference.}{TLC: maybe shorten this one, too. I can see you're TLing his keigo speech.  Maybe it can be shorter with "I'm most grateful" or "I deeply appreciate your" or something}{Editor: Yeah I was thinking most grateful myself}

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.940
Oh, it was no trouble!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.190
Pop, do my ears like you used to-kuru!

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.020
Alright.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.160
Behold, my turban curl-de gozaru!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.510
Hooray-kuru!

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.000
Your brother's really cute, isn't he?{TLC: sug. "Your brother's really cute, huh?" or something}

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:32.960
W-What?!{TLC: sug. just "What?!"}

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.340
I am a man!{Timer: Another long line split, change back if you desire}

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.740
A proud man, who strives to cast away the label of "cute"-de gozaru!{TLC: nuance. lit. "Calling me something like cute is rude!". sug. "How *dare* you call me cute?!" or split into two lines with something like "'Cute'?" "'sif"} {Hmmm, I think I like it this way}

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:40.970
He's so cool!

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:44.510
Huh...? C-Cool...?

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:47.370
Yeah! You're so manly and cool!{TLC: since this is a direct reply to a line where it was TLed "cool", "charming" sounds a bit odd}

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.290
U-Umm... Well...

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.180
I'm not really that...{TLC: possibly too long. Maybe just stick with "I wouldn't really..." or "I'm not really..."}

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:54.250
My, my...

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.520
Still, Pop-san, you've come at just the right time.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.400
So it would seem. If you would like to know about the Precure, allow me to explain-de gozaru.{TLC: something about the pacing here doesn't seem right to me. "If you would like to know about the Precures, please allow me to explain everything."}

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:06.120
Candy, if you'd give me the book about the legendary Precure...

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:06.830
Kuru?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.420
Huh? Where'd I put it-kuru?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.710
Don't tell me you lost it-de gozaru?

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:14.820
N-No! Gimme a sec-kuru!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:20.530
Let's see, I know I had it when I bumped into Miyuki-kuru!

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.080
Oh, I remember!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.790
I left that book in this mysterious library I found.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.350
A library...? Wait, don't tell me that library was...?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:33.330
Well, I dunno where it was. But it was inside a gigantic tree!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.760
That's ludicrous! I didn't know you could just stumble across it...{TLC: long? "What? How could someone..."}

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:42.170
Truth be told, you can access that library from any bookshelf in the world-de gozaru.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.440
Wow! Well then, let's go find that book!

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.470
Can we get there from here?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.480
Allow me to demonstrate.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.590
It's just like what I did before...{TLC: context: "It's just like last time!"}

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.020
Now then, let us make haste-de gozaru!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.660
Well, who'd have guessed...

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.340
There's five of those accursed Precure now!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.000
Is there no end to their annoyance?

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.750
It seems you have a quandary on your hands~

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.340
Who's there?!

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.460
It is I!{TLC: nuance. sug. "It is I!"}

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.260
Whoa...

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:11.230
Yeah, this is the place! I'm finally back...{TLC: nuance again: "It's been a while, though..." She's excited to be back again.  Lit. version: "It's been ages!" Lib. version "I'm glad to be back again!"}

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.590
Nice little spot, ain't it?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:15.950
It's strangely relaxing here.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:20.570
In this library, you can find all the world's fairy tales-de gozaru.{TLC: sug. "all the world's fairytales" for less verbosity (he doesn't say the extra stuff, anyway)}

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:21.380
Seriously?!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:24.040
I wanna read them all!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:24.710
Ow!

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.600
Ah! Here it is-kuru!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.630
Oh, thank goodness-de gozaru.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.650
Now we can finally begin-kuru!{TLC: sug.: "Now, at last:"}

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:34.920
This is how the tale of the legendary warriors, the Precure began-de gozaru.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:42.430
Long ago, there existed a land of fairy tales, known as Märchenland.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:47.740
Here, you would find the most adorable and playful fairies, just like in those fairy tales!

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.730
It was a most peaceful land.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:55.150
But one day, the evil emperor Pierrot sent his minions upon it, and invaded this fair land.{TLC: "set his eyes upon it" -> "brought his minions"}

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:05.250
The Royal Queen-sama of Märchenland fought valiantly to protect her homeland, but...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.410
The source of her powers, the Cure Décor, were stolen from her.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.420
Emperor Pierrot quickly placed a curse upon them, transforming them into red jewels,

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.400
and handed them to his minions.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:21.990
Wait, are those the red jewels they make Akanbe from?

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:23.130
That's right-kuru!

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:29.150
But the queen used the last of her power to seal Pierrot, and their battle ended in a stalemate.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:40.760
We wish to revive our queen, but to do so, we need to purify and collect the Cure Décor again.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:45.900
Once we have them, we can place the Cure Décor here, in the Decor Décor.{This is seriously what it's called. English "decor" followed by French "decor".}{As Doremi said: Yo Pop, I heard you like decors so I put a decor in your decor decor.}

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:46.870
In here-kuru.

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:50.260
You have some of them, right?

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.630
Why not put them in.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:08:00.280
Once we've filled the Decor Décor up with Cure Décor, we'll be able to revive her Majesty-de gozaru.{TLC: "be able to" can be removed for flow}{Editor: eh I think it works}

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.440
That won't take long if we give it our best shot!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.470
Right!

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:07.980
So what happened to the bad guys after all that, anyway?

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:10.320
We're getting to that-kuru!

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:14.800
The evil villains decided to think of a way to release the seal upon Emperor Pierrot...{TLC: they "tried to think of a way to release..."}

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.280
You're...!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.890
Joker!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.220
Hi~! You're all looking mighty fine!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:26.920
How rude! You didn't invite me to your little meeting?{TLC: not literal, but sug. a "Not fair! Why..." or something ("How rude! You didn't...") at the beginning}

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:29.630
Don't you want me here~?

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:33.690
Hmph! We don't need the likes of you here to figure out our plan of action.{TLC: the second half of the sentence feels kind of weak. sug. "We don't need [the likes of] you to figure out what to do!"}

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.070
All we need to do...

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.540
is make sure the humans and their world suffer a Bad End...

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.110
We steal their futures, steal their smiles,

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:49.050
and use the Bad Energy we leech to revive Emperor Pierrot-sama!{TLC: "and use their..." too short. sug. "and use the Bad Energy we bleed/leech/<insert cool, dramatic verb here> from them to"} {Editor: Bleed does sound cooler but leech makes more sense}

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:53.490
Yes, that's the spirit! Like always, our three commanders are in top form!

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.930
I know that soon enough you will bring the Earth... non, non, non!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:02.310
Bring this whole universe the Bad End it deserves!

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:09.610
In order to foil their evil plot, the queen sent her miraculous energy down to the Earth...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.540
And she said to Candy...

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.450
She said this-kuru.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:17.440
"Candy, you must find the five Precure,"-kuru {Editor: Someone really needs to look at this punctuation... I have no clue how daphuck it's supposed to be}

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.880
"Leave it to me-kuru!"{TLC: I prefer just "Leave it to me!" as in the Japanese}

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.050
That's what brought me here-kuru!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:26.050
Wow! So, come on, tell me! What happened next?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.120
That's me!{Orig: Me!? I happened?}{TLC: "That's me!" would do}

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.230
I'm there too!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:36.660
And Yayoi-chan, Nao-chan, and Reika-chan...

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.000
So, what's on the next page...?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.070
It's blank?!

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.300
Why?!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:47.120
Because you are the heroes of this story-de gozaru.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:51.580
What happens next is up to you to write-de gozaru.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.750
For us...?

00:09:56.590 --> 00:10:00.590
Oh, that reminds me! I have some great news for you all~!

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:04.380
There are only five Precure!

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.730
Just a trifling five!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:09.250
Hmph! Only five-oni?

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:12.200
I could take down a hundred if I had to!{TLC: take out?}

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.900
I don't care if there are a thousand of them!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:19.170
Well, my three commanders are in wonderful spirits today!

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.810
I win.

00:10:21.540 --> 00:10:24.450
Which means it's my turn to face them today!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.040
You be careful now!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:37.620
The legendary warriors, the Precure... oooh, this is stimulating!

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:45.190
So to put it simply, this wolf and his allies are attempting to give our world a Bad End...{TLC: "allow me to summarize" seems a little out of place for a listener to say. sug. "So, what you're saying is," "So, put simply." or something along those lines}

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:48.470
And we, as Precure, must stop them?

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:50.940
So we gather the Cure Décor

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:54.140
and bring back Märchenland's queen!

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:57.210
So we really are superheroes now?{TLC: sug. "So that makes us superheroes, right?"}

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.050
...Well, excluding the odd one over there.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.780
I'm glad to have your assistance-de gozaru.{TLC: if you're going this route, sug. "I'm glad to"}

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:02.390
Kuru!

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.400
Alright then! Let's make this happen!

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.460
Wait... there's one thing we've still gotta do!

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:09.810
What?

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.220
We need a catchphrase!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:13.890
I... what the heck...?

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.880
A <i>catchphrase</i>!{TLC: sug. italics on "catchphrase"}

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.290
We've finally got all five Precure together now!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:22.440
We need something cool to say after we all transform!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.640
...I don't care.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:26.560
...I care even less.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.290
Man, that's a harsh reaction...

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:34.650
...and that's a promising one!

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:36.740
Miyuki-chan, that's a great idea! {Did she say chan? I can't tell tbh}

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:43.520
I do admit that perhaps a catchphrase would improve our team's spirit...

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:46.390
Well, if you must, then decide on something quickly-de gozaru.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.110
Alright!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.140
Fine!

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:52.900
Let's get this over with!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:54.970
Okay!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:00.770
March!

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.630
Candy!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.950
Hey, I've got an idea!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.130
The five of us are...

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.830
Goprecure!{this is a reference to the show Himitsu Sentai Goranger, the original show in the Sentai series that'd go on to become Power Rangers. This is their rollcall phrase, and this is it's established translation. :3}{I'm perfectly OK with this}{Haha this is awesome}

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.730
Well?

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:17.790
But... we're not Goprecure?

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:21.470
What the legendary warriors do makes no sense at all-de gozaru.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.470
This will do nicely!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.310
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.280
...a Bad End!

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:39.680
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!{I use diffferent wordings for the English of this depending on who's saying it, even as the Japanese is technically the same, because of Japanese being a less flamboyant and more utilitarian language. I'm not married to the idea, however, so. }{TLC: to be frank, I'm not sure what you mean by that.} {Neither does the editor so I guess that means I'm leaving this alone for now}

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:54.200
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-sama!{This, however, I leave the same for all of them.}{TLC: minor point, but I think the progressive is a part of the drama of this line ("Pierrot is coming" rather than "Pierrot will come". I guess I'll talk about this kind of stuff in IRC}

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.640
They're trying to create a Bad End somewhere-de gozaru...!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.550
Huh?

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.640
You can tell?!

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.040
Then we'd better get out there!

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:08.910
You can use the book-gates to get there!

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.680
Book-gates...?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.920
Just visualize where it is you want to go - concentrate on it with all your mind.{TLC: long. "First, visualize the place you want to go." alternatively: meditate on, etc, a thesaurus is handy}

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:15.220
Uhh...

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.900
Take us to where people's smiles are being stolen.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.320
Y-Yeah, that'll work!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.540
{Context check this, nuku can mean a few things}Now, remove that book from the shelf.{TLC: okay, except "this"->"that"}

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.430
Right.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:28.600
Move the one on the left to the right.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.080
Now move the one below to the left.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.900
Finally, move the ones above it apart.{TLC: sug. keeping it as "Finally, move..."}

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:42.790
Now you should exit at a bookshelf close to where you want to go-de gozaru.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.050
Wow! Is that how it works!?{TLC: "Wow! Is that how it happened/works/etc?"}

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:46.780
Let's go!

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:48.050
Right!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.860
Hey, a penguin!

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:56.890
Don't...!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:13:59.760
Oh man...{TLC: needed?}

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.220
Hey, it's our local library!{TLC: "It's the local library!"}

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:08.070
Look at the townspeople!

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.980
Huh? Where's Miyuki-chan?{TLC: sug. just "Huh? Where's Miyuki?"}

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:15.540
Huh?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:21.860
Whe... {Editor: I'm just shorting it since she didn't even finish the word}

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:26.560
Where the heck am I?!

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.830
Miyuki lost focus, and ended up at the south pole-kuru!{TLC: for flow, "ended up at the south pole" works. Also, "the south pole" -> "Antarctica" is okay. She probably isn't actually at the south pole.}{Editor: I'm leaving it as south pole, I don't think Candy knows what Antartica is :P}

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.340
The south pole?!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.830
Where'd you all go? Why did I end up here?!

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:40.840
I just thought I'd like to see a penguin!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.360
Hey!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.310
Huh?

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.780
Hey! Miyuki-dono!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.460
Is that a penguin?!

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:52.140
Why would a penguin be coming to meet you-de gozaru?!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.390
Well, isn't this splendid!

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:57.950
Stop right there!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:58.970
What?

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:01.860
We will not let you give this world a Bad End!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.700
Precure! I've been waiting for you!

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:08.090
Come forth, Akanbe!

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.440
Akanbe!

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.460
Miyuki-dono...

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.710
Yeah?

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:23.280
I hope Candy hasn't caused any issues for you.

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.850
Huh? Candy?

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:29.880
Candy's been working really hard to help us ever since we first met.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.290
She's not been a bother at all!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.230
Is that so-de gozaru...

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.760
Why do you ask?

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.140
She is indeed very hardworking-de gozaru.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:43.700
But at heart, she's a crybaby who gets lonely easily.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.520
I must return to Märchenland soon.{TLC: sug. "I must return". keeps the tone with better flow}

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:53.140
However, I wanted to see that Candy would always be happy first-de gozaru.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.280
So, you see...

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:01.360
Yeah... you've gotta keep smiling, don't you?

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:06.260
She'll be alright. We all really care about her, you know.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:13.630
Wait...  happy... smiles...

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.310
I've got it!

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:18.900
Akankankanbe!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.120
We'll have to do what we can without her!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.480
But what about our catchphrase?

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.440
This really ain't the time to worry 'bout that!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.210
Aren't you going to transform?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.720
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.280
She's frozen over?

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.960
So, I had an idea...

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.460
What are you all whispering about?!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.230
Hey, I like it!

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.400
That sounds cool!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.830
Alright then, let's do it!{TLC: sug. "Alright, let's go!"}

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.800
Ready?

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.980
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:57.860
Go!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:00.270
Go, go!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.090
Let's go!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.380
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:36.700
Cure Happy!

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:41.170
Dazzling sun! {Editor: Sorry mag but Anxious's sounded kinda better}

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.480
Hot-blooded power! {Editor: Sorry mag but Anxious's sounded kinda better}

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.250
Cure Sunny!

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:52.280
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.340
Cure Peace!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.970
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.110
Cure March!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.930
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.600
Cure Beauty!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:17.650
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!{TLC: the Precures are the five lights, showing the way (sug. "blazing a path") to the future. This metaphor is in the OP, too.}

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:27.600
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:31.770
Alright!{Dora the Explorer time: We did it! We did it! We did it, Yay!}

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.100
Girls!

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:38.740
Hey, that's not fair! We weren't ready!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.320
Hurry, get up!

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.180
Crush them all!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.920
Akanbe!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.960
Time for me to make my move-de gozaru...

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:57.280
I will flatten you like a pancake-de gozaru!{so uh pop is literally making shit up at this point like i can google it and the only responses are japanese bbs threads complaining about pop making shit up i am not joking}{TLC: sounds like a mix of そうはいかない and (maybe) 金平 to me, but, yeah, whatever}

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.480
What is that thing?

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.030
Come get me!{I thought about K-On with this line. And just for hilarity and making people mad, "Come at me, bro!"}

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:04.940
The heck is that?!

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:06.320
Is that a press...?

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:07.780
It's my brother-kuru!

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:11.370
Pop can transform himself-kuru!{Like a boss. (Or Ninja)}

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:13.020
Akan, akan!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:14.980
Now's your chance! Take it down!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.970
Alright! Let's get him, girls!

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:18.750
One, two, three...

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.450
Precure...

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:23.950
Pancake Attack!{Now sit on it!}

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:32.950
Akan, akan... Akanbe!

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.800
Now's your chance, Happy-kuru!

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:37.800
Focus! Focus, focus, focus...!

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.840
Precure...

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.630
...Happy...

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.210
...Shower!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.110
Akanbe!

00:19:58.340 --> 00:19:59.790
Alright!

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.160
I'll get you for this!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.530
You got the Star Décor-de gozaru!

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.500
Here, place it in its holder-de gozaru.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:12.970
Okay!

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.670
It's really cute-kuru!{TLC: anything wrong with just "cute"?} {Editor: Nope}

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:20.010
You really saved us back there, Pop!

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.790
I didn't know you could transform!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.280
You were really cool!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.930
C-Cool...{TLC: since this is referring to the scene at the start, and will probably happen again if he ever comes back, maybe a consistent TL is a good idea} {Editor: OK, keeping consistent}

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.320
I-I'm not really that...

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.530
You're leaving, Pop-kuru?!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:40.230
Why-kuru?! Don't go-kuru!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:43.870
I have to take care of things back in Märchenland-de gozaru.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.930
Kuru...!

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:51.940
If you get lonely, you can always use the Phone Décor from the Decor Décor if you want to talk to me-de gozaru.{TLC: sug. keeping it at "if you get lonely", since that's what he was talking about earlier}

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:59.020
Come on, Candy. Don't you remember the promise we made-de gozaru?

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:01.290
Whenever we have to say bye-bye...

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.820
We do it with a smile-kuru.

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.130
Good girl-de gozaru.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:09.880
Well then!

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:17.230
Take care of my sister, and this world of yours-de gozaru!

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:18.810
I shall bid you all farewell-de gozaru!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:24.440
He's gone...

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.330
Candy!

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:35.060
Kuru?

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.890
It'll be alright, Candy.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:38.860
See?

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.760
We're all here for you!

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.560
We're friends.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.190
If you need us, we'll always be there for you.

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:46.830
So please don't cry.

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:53.730
Thank you-kuru! I... I'm so...

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.940
...so hungry-kuru.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:02.070
Oh, Candy!

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:06.360
It's not funny-kuru!

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:46.000
Kuru kuru!~

00:23:46.010 --> 00:23:48.850
Uwa! Candy, don't come out on your own!

00:23:48.850 --> 00:23:50.060
Why ~kuru?

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:54.090
It'd be a total disaster if Candy and the Precure are found out!

00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:56.280
Eh? That would be bad...

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:58.050
We must keep it a secret then

00:23:58.060 --> 00:24:00.340
If only we had a place to gather...

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:02.200
Oh, that's it!

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.850
Smile Precure!

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:09.830
Find your ultra happy smile!
